  <p>
    <strong>On Friday, the game token utilized within the Axie Infinity gaming realm has once again captured another all-time price high at $32.17 per unit. The game token has outperformed a great majority of crypto assets by commanding more than 844% in gains during the last month.</strong>
  </p>
  
  <h2>
    Axie Infinity Outperforms Crypto Competitors
  </h2>
  
  <p>
    The cryptocurrency community is chatting about the token axie infinity (AXS) again this week as the crypto asset has captured new price highs. On July 23, 2021, during the early morning trading sessions (EDT), AXS tapped an all-time high (ATH) at $32.17 per unit. The price of AXS has slid more than 3% from the ATH since, and is currently trading for $31.55 per unit at the time of writing. Over the last 24 hours, AXS has jumped a whopping 28.6% and 150.0% in two weeks.
  </p><figure id="attachment_476694" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-476694" style="width: 2494px" class="wp-caption aligncenter">
  
  <img decoding="async" srcset="https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/ya0bpt1v-300x172.png 300w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/ya0bpt1v-768x440.png 768w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/ya0bpt1v-1024x586.png 1024w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/ya0bpt1v-1536x879.png 1536w, https://static.news.bitcoin.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/ya0bpt1v-2048x1173.png 2048w, https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/ya0bpt1v.png 2494w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 2494px) 100vw, 2494px" loading="lazy" class="wp-image-476694 size-full" title="Ethereum Gaming Token Axie Infinity Taps Another All-Time Price High" src="https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/ya0bpt1v.png" alt="Ethereum Gaming Token Axie Infinity Taps Another All-Time Price High" width="2494" height="1428" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-476694" class="wp-caption-text">AXS/USD on July 23, 2021, at 9:30 am EDT.</figcaption></figure> 
  
  <p>
    Out of the more than 10,000 crypto assets in existence, the AXS market valuation is currently ranked in the 53rd position. The AXS market cap is around $1.9 billion on Friday and there’s $3.1 billion in global trades dedicated to this coin. Interestingly, statistics from cryptocompare.com show the top trading pair with AXS is tether (USDT) which commands 83% of AXS trades today. This is followed by the BUSD (10.34%), BTC (4.46%), BNB (0.68%), USD (0.58%), and ETH (0.18%) trading pairs.
  </p>
  
